  "scaleNote": "This is NASA GMAO MERRA-2, a global atmospheric reanalysis that assimilates observations, not a direct satellite retrieval. Each monthly value is the 550 nm total aerosol optical thickness from one nearest grid cell centered at 6.5\u00b0N, 125.0\u00b0E, about 17.3 km from the OpenStreetMap city-reference point. The grid is 0.5\u00b0 by 0.625\u00b0 (roughly 50\u201370 km); it is regional atmospheric-column context, not ground-level PM2.5/PM10, personal exposure, or a measurement at a specific community. The published Koronadal study used MODIS AOD at 470 nm: its values and MODIS-AERONET validation do not validate or directly compare with this coarser MERRA-2 550 nm series. Monthly means also cannot resolve individual haze days. Months without a valid value are omitted, not zero.",
